#: ../../modules/interaction.md:5 b543498991ca4fbeace80a7362960d09
msgid "Create and manage Graphical User Interfaces (GUIs) in Minecraft."
msgstr "在 Minecraft 中创建和管理图形用户界面（GUI）。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:8 66643495644a49e6bd5aded1e734d963
msgid "\"As far as the customer is concerned, the interface is the product.\""
msgstr "“就客户而言，界面就是产品。”"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:9 0860fd357b254050a00eea51ad027de8
msgid "Jef Raskin"
msgstr "杰夫·拉斯金（Jef Raskin）"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:13 99f2231cc2484c2380a9d4462d96b374
msgid "The Interaction API is a low-level API to create GUIs based on the [Interaction](https://minecraft.wiki/w/Interaction) entity. This API is low level since the possible events are directly and manually bound to the interaction."
msgstr "Interaction API 是一套基于[交互实体](https://minecraft.wiki/w/Interaction)创建 GUI 的底层接口，需要将各类事件直接绑定到对应的交互实体。"

