#: ../../modules/interaction.md:63 1f8ee96e33354842ac13d9d216472310
msgid "On Event"
msgstr "事件触发"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md 07c529be287c4e169c8804c87cfeb8c7
#: 19117d1b6c304f9ba7a3dcb4a496341a
msgid "Left Click"
msgstr "左键点击"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:71 3fe314760eab4f9086e1a8d428c462c9
msgid "Register a command to run when the left click is pressed on the current interaction. Each interaction can respond to multiple events."
msgstr "注册当前交互实体被左键点击时运行的命令。每个交互实体可以响应多个事件。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:75 ../../modules/interaction.md:100
#: ../../modules/interaction.md:125 ../../modules/interaction.md:150
#: ../../modules/interaction.md:175 a8e105f24fbe41e4b00e992ac72409f9
#: c574ebd880c6412f9c6364e65090877a ea05cb84cf7b492aa1d3afe601af9a4c
#: fcf0bc70f99f4a78b910d3cdeb12b89f fd059a0c08e648c88856ee4d097e2ab3
msgid "**Execution `as <entity>`**: Interaction entity for which the event is registered."
msgstr "**执行 `as <实体>`**：要注册事件的交互实体。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:80 f8718b7b8e464f98af75c87433903b95
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`string` **run**: Command to execute upon left-click."
msgstr "{nbt}`string` **run**: 左键点击时执行的命令。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:81 ../../modules/interaction.md:106
#: ../../modules/interaction.md:131 ../../modules/interaction.md:156
#: ../../modules/interaction.md:181 20cf8b0bbd4a458f9d59a1afc3c06cb9
#: 2b46a9ee68ae44ecafdf788fd1f100e5 a71e1d088bc5456da17c7a035f769f21
#: d3574663883b4537b591434728892bbd ff1d3b5d57d34e6d80e38466ab7f118f
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`string` {nbt}`compound` **executor**: Defines the entity on which the command will be executed. Can be either **\"source\"** for the player who performed the action or **\"target\"** for the interaction entity itself. A compound can also be used to target other entities:"
msgstr "{nbt}`string` {nbt}`compound` **executor**: 定义命令执行的目标实体。可选 **\"source\"**（执行动作的玩家）或 **\"target\"**（交互实体本身），也可用复合结构指定其他实体："

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:82 ../../modules/interaction.md:107
#: ../../modules/interaction.md:132 ../../modules/interaction.md:157
#: ../../modules/interaction.md:182 088ec233fc2f4d449c9a4af5ddd5900a
#: 0a8d50b9bd664bffa7483c7204d71e1b 52f5d248750c43a1bd06bcc59bf4d97e
#: a841a605af4c4494b82ccdd346214adf d0b4da9047314ba88dec1bb3c37ee59c
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`string` **selector**: Specifies entities for the command execution (`execute as <entity>`)."
msgstr "{nbt}`string` **selector**: 指定命令执行的实体选择器（`execute as <entity>`）。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:83 ../../modules/interaction.md:108
#: ../../modules/interaction.md:133 ../../modules/interaction.md:158
#: ../../modules/interaction.md:183 251699408d82484ea8c8985668171747
#: 27942a3e6185462d9311c0d3f0515ae6 717125b6fe7c46b79c061d3f3dc36cc9
#: a0a69f1dafec4b4c8dfdd754a7fb2df3 d9b834e182054631a93103f6b24b1d30
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`bool` **lazy**: Determines whether to resolve the selector immediately (`false`) or at runtime (`true`, default). If `false`, the selector must target only one entity, replacing the selector with that entity's UUID. Useful for optimizing execution, especially when targeting graphical representations. If multiple entities are targeted, the first one is selected."
msgstr "{nbt}`bool` **lazy**: 决定选择器是立即解析（`false`）还是运行时解析（`true`，默认值）。若为`false`，选择器必须精确指向单个实体（将被替换为该实体UUID），这对优化图形实体的执行效率特别有效。若选中多个实体，则选取首个匹配项。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:87 ../../modules/interaction.md:112
#: ../../modules/interaction.md:137 ../../modules/interaction.md:162
#: ../../modules/interaction.md:187 0e490c6b3ab0443082f42436ff1a5107
#: 4cccf7d79f614a4ca806a4dc8d3c28c9 bb8b129e876b4f6f83b07f36251fbbcb
#: bd66f91ab7a84a589230c051168d91bb e8318bb4de1a4da38a037a5e47023176
msgid "**Return**: The ID of the created event."
msgstr "**返回值**：创建的事件ID。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:89 b928d524cfd648178b6114edb686c4da
msgid "**State**: The interaction will trigger the event when left clicked."
msgstr "**状态**：交互实体将在被左键点击时触发事件。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md 19f9860bd8f5496a87f30d7b51ab222c
#: b6df2fe1e1f44d87a3f3594faa2615ee
msgid "Right Click"
msgstr "右键点击"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:96 99bf356d0214437c94341a6b3e1297f4
msgid "Register a command to run when the right click is pressed on the current interaction. Each interaction can respond to multiple events."
msgstr "注册当前交互实体被右键点击时运行的命令。每个交互实体可以响应多个事件。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:105 c0b1f061520e436991d68ddb9bdd6b33
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`string` **run**: Command to execute upon right-click."
msgstr "{nbt}`string` **run**: 右键点击时执行的命令。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:114 927db825b071499a82c5cd71ef97dccc
msgid "**State**: The interaction will trigger the event when right clicked."
msgstr "**状态**：交互实体将在被右键点击时触发事件。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md ec17aacf071a47a99b2174d671e14380
#: f8fb4631018a45c0ad8324bf5c75cacd
msgid "Hover"
msgstr "指向"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:121 a157f2e1a8344c95b5942f30a558daab
msgid "Register a command to run continuously while the player is hovering over the interaction. Each interaction can respond to multiple events."
msgstr "注册玩家准星持续指向交互实体时运行的命令。每个交互实体可以响应多个事件。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:130 01ffbde35eee4267b90876016a244652
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`string` **run**: Command to execute while hovering over the interaction."
msgstr "{nbt}`string` **run**：准星持续指向交互实体时执行的命令。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:139 f11e89533f9f45f7a7c9d9ff1d2e190b
msgid "**State**: The interaction will trigger the event continuously while hovered over."
msgstr "**状态**：准星持续指向交互实体时，会持续触发该事件。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md 0a7e5e88744c4ad09d99a6e96db227fc
#: c30a506cbed74392bcbc59d37d11c569
msgid "Enter Hover"
msgstr "开始指向"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:146 5bfc72b9776948d7b7a9c53d0aeae322
msgid "Register a command to run once when the player begins hovering over the interaction. Each interaction can respond to multiple events."
msgstr "注册玩家准星开始指向交互实体时运行一次的命令。每个交互实体可以响应多个事件。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:155 d0b3f5278d124df180ceac72ffbb3fb6
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`string` **run**: Command to execute when hovering begins."
msgstr "{nbt}`string` **run**: 准星开始指向时执行的命令。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:164 364621de05cd425a9b4b56e82cd9c2f5
msgid "**State**: The interaction will trigger the event once upon hover entry."
msgstr "**状态**：交互实体将在进入指向时触发一次事件。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md 01dfd70a45a148ffafa06f7ae3c5e7df
#: 15051c8572044679b436a1f7a7097779
msgid "Leave Hover"
msgstr "不再指向"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:171 3a6fba045adb4f01a3da34551d42b0ba
msgid "Register a command to run once when the player stops hovering over the interaction. Each interaction can respond to multiple events."
msgstr "注册玩家准星不再指向交互实体时运行一次的命令。每个交互实体可以响应多个事件。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:180 3724a68c15a740e6a19f42ce42c9ae84
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`string` **run**: Command to execute when hovering ends."
msgstr "{nbt}`string` **run**: 准星结束指向时执行的命令。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:189 025204ae0bb443e185fed26ec0665296
msgid "**State**: The interaction will trigger the event once upon hover exit."
msgstr "**状态**：交互实体将在离开指向时触发一次事件。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:192 bbc42e39a3a546ec91c7f44939c2051f
msgid "Edge Case"
msgstr "边缘情况"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:195 914f2ebedf8c4701a880c90d82dfafa4
msgid "If a player logs out while hovering over the interaction, the hover leave event will trigger on the executor. If the executor is the player, the event won't be triggered again when they log back in. Be sure to account for this edge case and handle it appropriately when the player returns."
msgstr "如果玩家在指向在交互实体上时退出游戏，指向离开事件将在执行者上触发。如果执行者是玩家，当他们重新登录时该事件将不会再次触发。请务必考虑这种边缘情况，在玩家返回时适当处理。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:200 f9c24e9f85914cd2a107923df4be6e25
msgid "*Example: Glow the interaction's icon while the interaction is hovered and unglow it when it is not hovered anymore:*"
msgstr "*示例：当交互实体被指向时让交互实体图标发光，不指向时取消发光：*"

