msgstr "**`#bs.interaction:callback/glow`**"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:227 0bb611f4ef4b4872a00f40bfba70cc4a
msgid "Makes the target entity glow."
msgstr "使目标实体发光。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md d9c26c4c82fc4b2baea7bb2953c86772
msgid "Unglow"
msgstr "取消发光"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:231 584b9a21862644c0be29e4bcb6224201
msgid "**`#bs.interaction:callback/unglow`**"
msgstr "**`#bs.interaction:callback/unglow`**"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:233 3e8a4d4f358948c7b051633a4dfa9ae3
msgid "Removes the glow effect from the target entity."
msgstr "移除目标实体的发光效果。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md 2e88f58bce92435ba3c7f754b8b7e489
msgid "None"
msgstr "无"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:237 4b152a62bf42430d949bd865076f2813
msgid "**`#bs.interaction:callback/none`**"
msgstr "**`#bs.interaction:callback/none`**"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:239 8aa2c9f9bf9a4966ba43a11fef7df449
msgid "An empty callback that does nothing. May be used as a placeholder or to explicitly indicate that no action should occur."
msgstr "不执行任何操作的空回调。可用作占位符或明确表示不应执行任何操作。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:244 40b4e48b26ad43708537068884296730
msgid "🏷️ Entity Tags"
msgstr "🏷️ 实体标签（Tags）"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:246 608aef8d4e9d4256a2f2b6eecbe12ea6
msgid "You can find below all tags available in this module."
msgstr "下面列出了此模块中所有可用的标签。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:250 917c42db78d84880a8634b2faa3b584f
msgid "Is Hovered?"
msgstr "是否被指向？"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:252 a1b567f78665408889f559b6c819fefa
msgid "**`bs.interaction.hovered`**"
msgstr "**`bs.interaction.hovered`**"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:254 86bc5af70e954bde95e55694de0606ca
msgid "Determine if an interaction is currently hovered by a player."
msgstr "判断交互实体当前是否被玩家指向。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:257 6d97c20239c34aa49038f597e7b09c35
msgid "This is useful in `hover_enter` and `hover_leave` events, which are per player. Since `hover_leave` triggers when a player stops hovering but doesn't check if all players have stopped, this tag can be used to determine when every player has left the interaction."
msgstr "这在 `hover_enter` 和 `hover_leave` 事件中很有用，因为这些事件是针对每个玩家的。由于 `hover_leave` 在玩家停止指向时触发，但不检查是否所有玩家都停止了，所以可以使用此标签来确定所有玩家是否都已离开交互实体。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:260 754763f1a0d148bba79fbeea18b0a0fe
msgid "**Credits**: Aksiome"
msgstr "**贡献者**：Aksiome"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:264 88e8a9b17bbc475e8822a6a3ed223e45
msgid "Is Source?"
msgstr "是否为源？"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:266 dc3984e39be04fdca5abbab24da82f09
msgid "**`bs.interaction.source`**"
msgstr "**`bs.interaction.source`**"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:268 a0562e77b88945d5a808423f104c936c
msgid "Usable only in the callback of an event. Determine if the current entity is the source of the event."
msgstr "仅在事件回调中可用。判断当前实体是否为事件的源。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:271 ../../modules/interaction.md:282
#: ../../modules/interaction.md:326 25cb8a23dc154a12b9e41397cdb0c044
#: 2876ca7e62a44b9690ad8765ed3cacb1 fb5294df61fc428783ff3c489be6b935
msgid "**Credits**: theogiraudet"
msgstr "**贡献者**：theogiraudet"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:275 25b12e5d597a44d28d6dcc3b5fb64277
msgid "Is Target?"
msgstr "是否为目标？"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:277 3751ab131aa54154896f3c91b2fb001f
msgid "**`bs.interaction.target`**"
msgstr "**`bs.interaction.target`**"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:279 7f4fad9e197246ee8890675a105bb0ff
msgid "Usable only in the callback of an event. Determine if the current entity is the target of the event."
msgstr "仅在事件回调中可用。判断当前实体是否为事件的目标。"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:286 ce022d505c8944db9138b1b377d7ab94
msgid "Listen to a Specific Event?"
msgstr "是否监听特定事件？"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:292 7305b2400f3d479a8293928a9180306b
msgid "**`bs.interaction.listen_right_click`**"
msgstr "**`bs.interaction.listen_right_click`**"

#: ../../modules/interaction.md:294 2fedf59842c64c54b7e2e1eff364c931
msgid "Determine if the current interaction listens to right-click interactions."
